# Branding & release

## Branding

- Product title is **Photo Classifier** (hero / `h1` / window title).
- Credit is **by gemadipada** in small text under the title — never inline in the big title.
- Do **not** use `Photo Classifier by GEMADIPADA` as the visible UI title.
- `package.json` `productName` / electron-builder `productName` = `Photo Classifier` (app + DMG name).
- Artifact pattern: `Photo Classifier-${version}-${os}-${arch}.${ext}`
- App icon lives in `build/icon.png` + `build/icon.icns` (wired in electron-builder). Replace both when the logo changes, then bump + rebuild.

## Release / DMG

- Every release **must** wipe and replace files in `release/` immediately — no leftover older versions, no stale same-version DMG/zip.
- Start with `node scripts/clean-release.cjs --all` (full wipe). After copy-back, prune with `node scripts/clean-release.cjs` so only current-version `.dmg`/`.zip` remain.
- Do **not** run a full wipe between Mac and Windows builds in the same release — that deletes the fresh Mac DMGs. Use `npm run dist:all`, or `dist` then `dist:win` (win script does not wipe).
- Flow: bump version → commit/push → build from space-free `/tmp` copy → copy artifacts into repo `release/` → prune to current version only → **git tag `vX.Y.Z` + publish GitHub Release** with the DMG/zip assets (`gh release create vX.Y.Z …`).
- Commands: `npm run dist` (mac), `npm run dist:win` (win, no wipe), `npm run dist:all` (wipe once, then mac+win).
- Never leave `1.0.0` next to `1.0.1` in `release/`.
- Version always becomes an annotated/git tag `v{version}` pushed to origin; release page is the source of download links.
